-critical needs in mind, we deliver end-to-end technology solutions connecting the space, air, land, sea and cyber domains in the interest of national security. We support customers in more than 100 countries, with our largest customers being various departments and agencies of the U.S. Government, their prime contractors and international allies. Our capabilities have defense and civil government applications, as well as commercial applications.","zh":"L3Harris Technologies, Inc. 是國防工業中值得信賴的顛覆者。考慮到客戶的關鍵任務需求，我們提供連接太空、空中、陸地、海洋和網路領域的端到端技術解決方案，以維護國家安全。我們為 100 多個國家的客戶提供支持，其中最大的客戶是美國政府的各個部門和機構、其主承包商和國際盟友。我們的能力涵蓋國防和民事政府應用以及商業應用。"},{"en":"Our fiscal year ends on the Friday nearest December 31. The fiscal year ended January 2, 2026 (\"fiscal 2025\") included 52 weeks, fiscal year ended January 3, 2025 (\"fiscal 2024\") included 53 weeks, and the fiscal year ended December 29, 2023 (\"fiscal 2023\") included 52 weeks. Unless the context otherwise requires, the terms \"we,\" \"our,\" \"us,\" \"Company\" and \"L3Harris\" as used in this Annual Report on Form 10-K (this \"Report\") mean L3Harris Technologies, Inc. and its subsidiaries.","zh":"我們的財政年度於最近的 12 月 31 日星期五結束。截至 2026 年 1 月 2 日的財政年度（「2025 財年」）包括 52 週，截至 2025 年 1 月 3 日的財政年度（「2024 財政年度」）包括 53 週，截至 2023 年 12 月 29 日的財政年度（「2023 週，截至 2023 年 12 月 29 日的財政年度（「2023 週」）包括 52 週。除非上下文另有要求，否則本 10-K 表格年度報告（本「報告」）中使用的術語「我們」、「我們的」、「本公司」和「L3Harris」是指 L3Harris Technologies, Inc. 及其子公司。"},{"en":"We structure our operations primarily around the capabilities we provide and we report our financial results in four operating segments, which are also our reportable segments or business segments. From time to time, we acquire or divest businesses and strategically realign businesses within and across our business segments to optimize existing capabilities and enhance the efficiency with which we develop and deliver on our contracts. For financial information with respect to our business segments, see Note 14: Business Segments in the Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements in this Report (the \"Notes\"). Beginning fiscal 2026, we streamlined our business segments from four business segments to three business segments, more closely aligning common capabilities and business models. See Note 16: Subsequent Events in the Notes.","zh":"我們主要圍繞我們提供的能力來建立我們的運營，並在四個營運部門報告我們的財務業績，這也是我們的可報告部門或業務部門。我們不時收購或剝離業務，並對業務部門內部和跨業務部門的業務進行策略性重組，以優化現有能力並提高我們開發和履行合約的效率。本公司業務分部的財務資料請參閱本報告合併財務報表附註（以下簡稱「附註」）的附註14：業務分部。從 2026 財年開始，我們將業務部門從四個業務部門精簡為三個業務部門，更加緊密地結合共同能力和業務模式。參見註16：期後事項。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-01-02","items":[{"name":"Space & Airborne Systems","val":6946000000,"zh":"空間與機載系統部門"},{"name":"Integrated Mission Systems","val":6630000000,"zh":"綜合任務系統部門"},{"name":"Communication Systems","val":5673000000,"zh":"通訊系統部門"},{"name":"Aerojet Rocketdyne","val":2845000000,"zh":"Aerojet Rocketdyne 部門"}],"total":null},"prod":{"end":"2026-01-02","items":[{"name":"Product","val":15487000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":6378000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":null}},"peers":["RTX","HII","NOC","LDOS","GD"]}}